---
interface Props { title: string; description: string }
const { title, description } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="thermal-comparison" aria-labelledby="thermal-comp-title">
  <div class="thermal-comparison__shell">
    <header>
      <span>Validación técnica</span>
      <h2 id="thermal-comp-title">{title}</h2>
      <p>{description}</p>
    </header>
    <div class="thermal-comparison__chart" aria-label="Comparativa técnica del comportamiento del equipo antes y después del servicio térmico">
      <div class="thermal-comparison__column thermal-comparison__column--before">
        <div class="column-badge">
          <span class="state-tag state-tag--before"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true"></i> ANTES DEL SERVICIO</span>
          <strong>Restricción térmica</strong>
        </div>
        <ul class="state-list">
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-temperature-arrow-up state-icon state-icon--crit" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Temperatura inestable</strong>
              <span>Picos térmicos rápidos al abrir juegos o aplicaciones pesadas</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-fan state-icon state-icon--warn" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Ventiladores forzados</strong>
              <span>Turbinas al 100% de RPM con ruido excesivo continuo</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line-down state-icon state-icon--crit" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Frecuencia variable (Throttling)</strong>
              <span>CPU y GPU bajan GHz para proteger el silicio, provocando caídas de FPS</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved state-icon state-icon--crit" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Riesgo de corte de emergencia</strong>
              <span>Apagados súbitos por protección PROCHOT bajo carga sostenida</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="thermal-comparison__axis" aria-label="Procedimiento técnico aplicado">
        <div class="axis-steps">
          <span class="axis-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-stethoscope" aria-hidden="true"></i> Diagnóstico</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down axis-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="axis-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-spray-can-sparkles" aria-hidden="true"></i> Limpieza</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down axis-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="axis-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-droplet" aria-hidden="true"></i> Interfaz TIM</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down axis-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="axis-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-compress" aria-hidden="true"></i> Montaje</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down axis-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="axis-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple" aria-hidden="true"></i> Prueba</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="thermal-comparison__column thermal-comparison__column--after">
        <div class="column-badge">
          <span class="state-tag state-tag--after"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> DESPUÉS DEL SERVICIO</span>
          <strong>Respuesta térmica validada</strong>
        </div>
        <ul class="state-list">
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-temperature-arrow-down state-icon state-icon--ok" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Transferencia interfacial eficiente</strong>
              <span>Disipador absorbe y evacua el calor sin barreras de aire ni pasta seca</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-fan state-icon state-icon--ok" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Ventilación estable y silenciosa</strong>
              <span>Curva PWM progresiva sin ruidos de turbina constante</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high state-icon state-icon--ok" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Rendimiento sostenido de diseño</strong>
              <span>Frecuencias turbo constantes sin estrangulamiento térmico</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check state-icon state-icon--ok" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Operación segura bajo estrés</strong>
              <span>Estabilidad térmica certificada en banco de pruebas antes de entregar</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <small class="thermal-comparison__note">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i> Las respuestas térmicas reales dependen del modelo, arquitectura del disipador, temperatura ambiental y estado del procesador y gráfica. No publicamos temperaturas simuladas ni garantizamos cifras idénticas para todos los equipos.
    </small>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .thermal-comparison {
    padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px) 0;
    color: #071f3a;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .thermal-comparison__shell {
    width: min(1140px, calc(100% - (var(--page-gutter, 40px) * 2)));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .thermal-comparison header {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 0 36px;
  }
  .thermal-comparison header > span {
    color: #1672ca;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .thermal-comparison h2 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #071f3a;
    font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.2vw, 2.85rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .thermal-comparison header p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #24435f;
    line-height: 1.68;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }
  .thermal-comparison__chart {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 140px 1fr;
    align-items: stretch;
    border: 1px solid #d6e1ea;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(7, 31, 58, 0.05);
  }
  .thermal-comparison__column {
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .thermal-comparison__column--before {
    background: #fff8f8;
    border-right: 1px solid #fee2e2;
  }
  .thermal-comparison__column--after {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-left: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }
  .column-badge {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }
  .state-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .state-tag--before { color: #dc2626; }
  .state-tag--after { color: #16a34a; }
  .column-badge strong {
    font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #071f3a;
  }
  .state-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .state-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .state-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .state-icon--crit { color: #ef4444; }
  .state-icon--warn { color: #f59e0b; }
  .state-icon--ok { color: #10b981; }
  .state-list li div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .state-list li strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #071f3a;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .state-list li span {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: #334155;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .thermal-comparison__axis {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #071f3a;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 20px 8px;
  }
  .axis-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .axis-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: #e0f2fe;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .axis-pill i { color: #38bdf8; }
  .axis-arrow {
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .thermal-comparison__note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .thermal-comparison__note i {
    color: #1672ca;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .thermal-comparison__chart {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .thermal-comparison__column--before {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #fee2e2;
    }
    .thermal-comparison__column--after {
      border-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .thermal-comparison__axis {
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .axis-steps {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .axis-arrow {
      transform: rotate(-90deg);
    }
  }
</style>
